cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scrutate in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Scrutate
abstract: >-
  Universal instant code search and persistent code intelligence, in one Rust binary.
  Engine A searches any folder with no index; Engine B indexes a repository for ranked
  search by meaning or name, definitions, callers, references and the tests a git diff
  touches. A CLI, an MCP server for AI coding agents, a language server and Python bindings.
authors:
  - given-names: Cris
    family-names: Nahine
repository-code: "https://github.com/scrutate/scrutate"
url: "https://github.com/scrutate/scrutate"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - code search
  - grep
  - code intelligence
  - semantic code search
  - MCP server
  - language server
  - tree-sitter
  - Rust
